WEBVTT

00:09:59.595 --> 00:10:03.974
for the fair and just distribution
of benefits of Justice40

00:10:04.016 --> 00:10:06.226
to frontline communities of Black,

00:10:06.268 --> 00:10:08.437
brown and Indigenous peoples.

00:10:09.021 --> 00:10:13.651
But we must make certain
that the investments and the benefits

00:10:13.651 --> 00:10:15.903
reach the communities intended,

00:10:15.944 --> 00:10:20.407
given the bias and ambivalence
of many state and local governments.

00:10:20.866 --> 00:10:22.660
But if done effectively,

00:10:22.701 --> 00:10:24.828
this can be transformative

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:30.042
and could stop the cycle
of exploitation and extraction.